{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24644","headline":"题新涧亭兼酬寄朝中亲故见赠 · 白居易","name":"题新涧亭兼酬寄朝中亲故见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处披襟风快哉，一亭临涧四门开。\n金章紫绶辞腰去，白石清泉就眼来。\n自得所宜还独乐，各行其志莫相咍。\n禽鱼出得池笼後，纵有人呼可更回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}